    {
      "id": "u_5832cba9023cb501eea0eecb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Only some note types have their content scanned for links: __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Relation Map__TRILIUM_PH_5__ and __TRILIUM_PH_6__AI__TRILIUM_PH_7__ chats. A link written inside a __TRILIUM_PH_8__Code__TRILIUM_PH_9__ note is not registered and will not appear as a backlink on the target note. A relation set manually on a code note does still count.",
      "sourceHash": "5832cba9023cb501eea0eecb3d0a9f944a14ddc4898a59bf42168d5260df8c11",
      "context": "Backlinks > What counts as a backlink",
