      "kind": "li",
      "source": "As a badge in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Status bar__TRILIUM_PH_1__ showing the number of backlinks. The badge only appears when the note is being read normally (not in a revision or attachment view) and when there is at least one backlink; pressing it opens the section above.",
